      "writtenOn": "2024-10-17T12:58:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let me read the whole code to really understand the flow, but yes calling a vcpu \u0027runnable\u0027 w/o being in the \u0027KVM_MP_STATE_RUNNABLE\u0027 stands out. The PSCI code should really only be useful to \u0027drive\u0027 the mp_state intuitively. I\u0027ll read through, sorry if this isn\u0027t useful.",
